@startuml
title SA-F08A — Dedicated merchant recovery
caption F08 · Identity and Merchant Operations · FN-ADM-01–02
actor "Merchant" as M
participant "Identity boundary" as I
participant "Verified channel" as C
participant "Authorized operator" as O
M -> I : Request recovery
alt Previously enrolled verified channel available
 I -> C : Send bounded admin-only challenge
 M -> I : Return verification
 alt Challenge valid and unused
  I --> M : Recover dedicated admin access
 else Invalid, expired or unknown contact
  I --> M : Safe recovery feedback, no session
 end
else Neither verified channel available
 M -> O : Initiate controlled owner verification
 O -> I : Reset enrolled contact only after approved evidence
 I -> I : Revoke prior sessions and record audit
 I --> M : Start new verified challenge
end
@enduml
